      "content": "i guess. it's just hard to see how anything could be \"meaningful\" when the part of me that actually did things is just gone. it's like the version of me that mattered died, and this person left behind is just... a shell. does it ever feel like some people are just meant to be done? like they've finished their part and there's nothing left to contribute?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
